      'Teams structure collaboration through workflows built on feature branching, pull requests, and code review — the patterns are consistent even as specific workflows vary by team and context.',
      'Git\'s recovery capabilities (including the reflog) mean committed work is rarely truly lost — understanding this provides the confidence to use Git\'s full power without excessive fear of mistakes.',
